# The dev-only paths: what `main` never carries (v0.7 master spec 8.2).
# publish-main builds main's tree from a dev commit minus every path listed
# here (master spec 8.3 step 1; capture W1 item 4).
#
# Format: one entry per line, relative to the repository root; `#` comments
# and blank lines are ignored. Each entry is a git pathspec in glob magic
# (`:(glob)<entry>`): a trailing `/` names a directory and everything under
# it; `*` and `**` follow git's glob rules.
#
# Not listed, because they are replaced rather than removed (8.3 step 1):
# the dev README.md and CLAUDE.md, replaced by game-mode/README.md and
# game-mode/CLAUDE.md, and the dev .claude/settings.json, replaced by
# game-mode/settings.json.

# Development records
specs/
issues/
.tech

# Game mode's own sources: this file, publish.py, spoiler-words, the
# game-mode README.md, CLAUDE.md and settings.json
game-mode/

# The skill that publishes main, and any dev settings
.claude/skills/publish-main/
.claude/settings.local.json

# The build's tools and tests
tools/tests/
tools/go-sbom
tools/fake_aging/

# The bricks' software bills of materials
bricks/*/sbom/
